{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "和好方法：谈感受", "content": "和好时可以谈感受，例如说“老公，我觉得好难过，我们刚才吵一架，我心里好不舒服”“老公，我好害怕，我怕你不喜欢我了”。先生也可以说“老婆不要离开我，我不能没有你”。谈感受包括谈对吵架的感受、此时此刻的孤独感受等。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["谈感受", "和好方法"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-54e16185d7df-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-54e16185d7df", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-54e16185d7df-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
